        <UserObject id="hook-gate-head" label="&lt;b&gt;3. Hook gate before an edit&lt;/b&gt; (custom)&lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt;Claude Code asks the hook before Edit, Write, MultiEdit or NotebookEdit; advisory mode warns, blocking mode exits 2.&lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Trigger:&lt;/b&gt; hook: PreToolUse on a file tool&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Runs on:&lt;/b&gt; Claude Code · &lt;b&gt;Owner:&lt;/b&gt; goal_guard_hook.py&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Budget:&lt;/b&gt; under 1 s per call (measured median 58 ms)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Depends on components:&lt;/b&gt; .gg/ records, Hook captures&lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt;[back to Overview]" link="data:page/id,overview"><mxCell style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=12;movable=0;resizable=0;rotatable=0;bendable=0;editable=0;deletable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="20" width="2245" height="164" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
